<title>HONG KONG: Henderson China interim net at HK$164 mln.</title>
<headline>Henderson China interim net at HK$164 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. dollar)	  46.0   vs  N/A (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    12.0   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    163.96 vs  11.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		     469.68 vs  12.07</p>
<p>    Company name		 Henderson China Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 22-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Henderson China, a spinoff unit of Henderson Land Development Co Ltd, holds and manages all Henderson Land property developments and investment interests in China.</p>
<p>Comparison figures for earnings per share were not shown as the company became a publicly listed company subsequent to December 31, 1995, and the amounts presented were not appropriate for the purpose of comparison.</p>
<p>The company was listed on March 28, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
